WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
第 1 集 · 今天不要上班，咪养你
Episode 1 · No work today

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:11.710
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.630
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.030
你：乖宝给我亲一口
You: Come here, sweetie, give me a kiss.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.210
只能一口，小小的。
Just one. A tiny one.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.870
亲过啦，现在你要休息。
Kissed you. Now you rest.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.310
咪去做早餐啦。
Mii's off to make breakfast.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.830
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
These go this way. I knew that.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:14.650
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。不是故意的。
I tested the jam. With my paw. By accident.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.810
午饭得先买菜。买菜得先……穿条厉害的裤子。
Lunch needs shopping. Shopping needs... fancy pants.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:45.410
第 2 集 · 出门要穿得很可靠
Episode 2 · Dressed for the job

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:51.050
穿哪套呀？咪得看起来像知道鸡蛋在哪儿。
Which outfit? I need to look like I know where the eggs are.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.860
你：你想穿哪个，咪自己决定
You: Which one do you want to wear? Mii decides.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.010
咪来决定？好。
Mii decides? Okay.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.950
红蝴蝶结。很像大人。
The red bow. Very grown-up.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.830
帮咪穿上好不好？
Help Mii put it on?

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.470
很像大人。就是个头还小。
Very grown-up. Still very small.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:39.510
只有一个蛋。这个午饭有点小。你想吃什么呀？
We have one egg. That's not a very big lunch. What shall I make?

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.500
你：我想吃过桥米线
You: I want crossing-the-bridge rice noodles

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.890
过桥米线？好高级。
Bridge noodles? So fancy.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.470
热汤对咪来说太难啦。
Hot soup is too big for Mii.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.290
不过面条，交给咪。
Noodles, though. Mii's on it.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:04.150
太大啦。这瓶水得自己开一辆车。
Too big. This bottle needs its own car.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:18.290
你乖乖休息。想咪之前，咪就回来。应该吧。
You stay cozy. I'll be back before you miss me. Probably.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:32.450
第 3 集 · 一只猫的采购清单
Episode 3 · One little shopping list

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:36.030
开一下嘛。咪很有礼貌地问啦。
Open, please. I asked nicely.

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:44.490
豆子？你不在名单上。对不起呀。
Beans? You're not on my list. Sorry.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:52.510
草莓还是蓝莓？它们都看着咪呢。
Strawberries or blueberries? They're both looking at me.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:58.600
你：樱桃
You: Cherries

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:06.670
樱桃？咪找找看。
Cherries? Let Mii look.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:09.750
没有樱桃。不过有草莓！
No cherries. Strawberries, though!

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.610
红红的，甜甜的。咪就拿这个。
Red and sweet. Mii takes these.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.490
小顾客，需要帮忙吗？
Need a hand, little shopper?

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:21.290
要那小袋。这是咪的午饭。咪今天要养两个人。
That little bag, please. It's my lunch. I'm shopping for two.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.290
给你。真是个懂事的小帮手！
Here you go. What a thoughtful little helper!

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:38.370
咪这么短，收据怎么这么长。
That's a very long receipt for a very short cat.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:47.450
送货到啦！没有压扁的。咪也没有。
Delivery! Nothing squished. Not even me.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.200
第 4 集 · 这个锅，它不听话
Episode 4 · The pan had other plans

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:25.890
咪大厨准备好啦。大厨有一点点紧张。
Chef Mii is ready. The chef is a little nervous.

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:33.310
意面下锅。计时开始。咪特别有条理。
Pasta in. Timer on. I am extremely organized.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:41.710
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce is sticking. Very attached to the pan.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:52.290
小火。哦。咪以为火大一点，午饭就快一点。
Low heat. Oh. I thought faster heat meant faster lunch.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.310
你：按照教程来做，加油！
You: Follow the tutorial. You can do it!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.710
跟着视频做，收到。
Follow the video. Got it.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.610
小火，画小圈。
Low heat. Small circles.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.630
味道对了，马上就好！
Smells right. Almost there!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:18.010
芝士，菠菜，意面。一个一个来，不许挤。
Cheese, spinach, pasta. Everybody gets a turn.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:31.150
午饭好啦！快来看。
Lunch is ready! Come see.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.810
成功的那份给你。
I made the good version for you.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:52.390
小小一口。咪吹过了。怕烫，吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. I blew on it. Twice, just in case.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.800
第 5 集 · 请这位客人认真吃饭
Episode 5 · Please enjoy your lunch

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.290
味道如何？
How does it taste?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.230
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口。
You: So good! I want more. Feed me another bite.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:07.030
还要？咪好开心！
More? Mii's so happy!

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:13.770
小小一口，吹凉了。
Tiny bite. Blown cool.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.650
好厨师可以摸摸头吗？
Good chef gets a pat?

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:36.010
吃完啦？那轮到咪啦。咪的肚子已经喊了好几遍啦。
All finished? Then it's my turn. My tummy has been making announcements.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:53.410
你去舒服地歇着。咪洗碗。碗也就比咪高一点点。
Go get cozy. I'll do the dishes. They're only a little taller than me.

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:58.530
一滴。怎么长出一座泡泡山呀？
One drop. Why is there a bubble mountain?

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:17.350
哦。房子也想洗个澡。
Oh. The house wants a bath too.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.520
第 6 集 · 家里还有一只猫？
Episode 6 · A house full of little jobs

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:36.190
打扫的衣服。很严肃的口袋。没口袋？也很严肃。
Cleaning outfit. Very serious pockets. No pockets? Still serious.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:43.790
纸巾！差一点，家里就要下雪啦。
A tissue! You nearly became snow. Indoors.

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:08.310
还有一只橘猫？哦，是咪掉的备用毛毛。
Another orange cat? Oh. It's my spare fluff.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:34.270
你喝一小口。你还饱饱的？那好吧。
A little drink for you. You're still full? Okay.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:42.710
谁踩的呀？哦。保洁阿姨。就是咪。
Who walked here? Oh. The cleaning lady. That's me.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:52.270
这个也要呀？好吧。吃晚饭的时候不许提。
Even this? Okay. Nobody mention this at dinner.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.090
休息时间。咪的爪爪已经投诉啦。
Break time. My paws have filed a complaint.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:20.150
第 7 集 · 咪只看一个视频
Episode 7 · Just one video

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:24.150
就看一个。给咪累坏的小脑袋放个假。
One video. For my very tired brain.

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:42.550
这是学习。你看它的小短腿。忙得不得了！
It's research. Look at his little legs. They're so busy!

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:46.990
你：你也学它跳一个
You: You dance like it too

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:54.370
咪也跳？好！
Mii dance? Okay!

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:57.450
扭一扭，扭一扭，像柯基一样！
Wiggle, wiggle. Like the corgi!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.370
哦！衣服洗好啦！
Oh! The laundry's done!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:08.130
哦！衣服洗好啦。咪刚才很忙……忙着坐着。
Oh! The laundry. I was being very busy... sitting down.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:25.270
找到你的朋友啦。袜子要结伴出门。
Found your friend. Socks should travel in pairs.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:34.810
玩一局吗？咪会一招。很厉害的一招。
Want to play? I know one move. It's a really good one.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.950
第 8 集 · 下午陪咪玩一局
Episode 8 · One round with Mii

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.950
你：先出剪刀，再出布，虚晃咪一枪。
You: Scissors first, then paper. Fake Mii out.

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:43.550
要耍花招？咪准备好了。
Tricks? Mii is ready.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:52.190
剪刀？不对，是布？！
Scissors? No, paper?!

00:11:54.660 --> 00:12:05.710
吃点水果吗？奖品是水果。每个人都有水果。
Snack break? You can win fruit. Everybody wins fruit.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:58.870
狡猾的人类。咪都看见了。
Sneaky human. Mii saw that.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:10.510
就吃水果，还是盖一条酸奶小被子？
Just fruit, or a little yogurt blanket?

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:17.650
你：想吃草莓布丁
You: I want strawberry pudding

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:24.770
草莓布丁？好香。
Strawberry pudding? Yum.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:27.770
布丁没有。酸奶也是软软的。
No pudding. Yogurt is soft too.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.050
草莓酸奶，马上来！
Strawberry yogurt, coming up!

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:37.430
你的有水果味。咪的……肯定不是水果味。
Yours is fruity. Mine is... definitely not fruity.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:43.370
咪只是让眼睛歇一下。它们今天也很努力。
Just resting my eyes. They're very hardworking eyes.

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.730
第 9 集 · 晚饭这次有把握
Episode 9 · A better dinner plan

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:02.430
呀，晚饭时间啦。咪的眼睛放了一个大假。
Oh! Dinner time. My eyes had a whole vacation.

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:09.590
先看。再做。慌张……菜谱上没有这一项。
Read first. Cook second. Panic... not on the list.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:18.110
这些是咪给晚饭留的。早上的咪很有远见。
I saved these for dinner. Past me was very helpful.

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:26.010
小火。这个按钮咪认识啦。我们现在是朋友。
Low heat. I know this button now. We're friends.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:40.390
餐桌还是窗边？咪可以送餐。迷你送餐。
Table, or the window? I can do room service. Very small room service.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:45.230
你：去卧室吃吧，我想躺着，你喂我好吗？
You: Let's eat in the bedroom. I want to lie down. Will you feed me?

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.000
想躺着？咪喂你。
Lie down? Mii feeds you.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:54.390
卧室太远啦，窗边有软垫子。
Bed's far. Window has cushions.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:57.730
过来躺着，勺子在咪这儿。
Come lie there. Mii has the spoon.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.210
真好吃，咪。你做得特别好。
That was lovely, Mii. You did so well.

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:07.310
你喜欢呀？那咪去收拾啦。等会儿还能摸摸头吗？
You liked it? I can tidy up now. More head pats later?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:25.010
给以后的点心。以后的咪会谢谢现在的咪。
Future snacks. Future me will say thank you.

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:32.550
都做完啦。咪只忘了……什么都没忘！等咪看看。嗯！
All done. I only forgot... nothing! Let me check. Nothing.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.550
制服脱掉。小老板下班啦。
Uniform off. Tiny boss is off duty.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.540
第 10 集 · 今天被养得很好
Episode 10 · Looked after, all day

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:23.890
还要什么吗？水？被子？小一点的被子……给咪？
Anything else? Water? A blanket? A smaller blanket... for me?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:27.340
你：你再帮我按摩一下吧，肩膀有点酸
You: Give me another massage? My shoulders are sore.

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:30.730
按摩？咪的爪爪准备好了。
Massage? Mii's paws are ready.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:34.850
踩一踩，踩一踩。舒服点了吗？
Knead, knead. Feel better?

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:37.890
现在轮到咪要抱抱了。
Now Mii needs a hug.

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:48.150
做得特别好。现在轮到我照顾咪啦。
You did wonderfully. Now it's my turn to look after you.

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.550
晚安，我的小宝。
Good night, my little one.
